  '9.2.4.4': "Apply properties of congruent figures to solve situations and logically justify results.",
  '9.2.4.5': "Accurately interpret and use words and phrases such as “if ... then,” “if and only if,” “all” and “not.” Recognize the logical relationships between an “if ... then” statement and its inverse, converse and contrapositive.",
  '9.2.4.6': "Analyze the validity of a logical argument and give counterexamples to disprove a statement.",
